{"repositoryId":1041920680,"availability":"available","full":"TencentCloudADP/youtu-agent","name":"youtu-agent","description":"A simple yet powerful agent framework that delivers with open-source models","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":4625,"forks":487,"created":"2025-08-21T07:58:13Z","updated":"2026-03-21T07:18:28Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://tencentcloudadp.github.io/youtu-agent/","topics":["agent-framework","agents","openai-agents","python"],"demo":"https://www.tencentcloud.com/document/product/1255/70381","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T17:00:55.109Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T17:00:55.109Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T17:00:55.109Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T17:00:55.109Z","stars":4625,"forks":487}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["| 中文 | 日本語 | 🌟 Performance | 💡 Examples | ✨ Features | 🚀 Getting Started | 📢 Join Discord or WeChat |","Youtu-Agent is a flexible, high-performance framework for building, running, and evaluating autonomous agents. Beyond topping the benchmarks, this framework delivers powerful agent capabilities, e.g. data analysis, file processing, and deep research, all with open-source models. Additionally, the framework supports experience-based learning and end-to-end RL training to enhance agent capabilities.","Youtu-Agent is designed to provide significant value to different user groups:"],"features":["Verified performance: Achieves state-of-the-art performance on WebWalkerQA (71.47%) and GAIA (72.8%) using purely open-weight models (e.g., DeepSeek-V3), establishing a strong open-source baseline.","Automated Agent Generation: Introduces two paradigms: a Workflow mode for standard tasks and a Meta-Agent mode for complex requirements. The framework supports automated generation of tool code, prompts, and…","Continuous Experience Learning: The Agent Practice module enables low-cost continuous evolution via Training-Free GRPO. Agents accumulate experience and improve performance (e.g., +5.4% on AIME 2025) through in-context…","Scalable and Stable Agent RL: The Agent RL module provides a complete pipeline for end-to-end reinforcement learning. By integrating with distributed frameworks, it addresses stability and scalability challenges,…","Practical use cases: Out-of-the-box support for tasks like data analysis, literature review, personal file organization, retrieval-augmented generation, and PPT generation."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TencentCloudADP/youtu-agent/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"3a48406f752768459010fcbe9e02ac5fe430535e30b4c6897e3f3d10d2f83a5a","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T17:00:55.194Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T17:00:55.194Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"| 中文 | 日本語 | 🌟 Performance | 💡 Examples | ✨ Features | 🚀 Getting Started | 📢 Join Discord or WeChat |","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TencentCloudADP/youtu-agent/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"3a48406f752768459010fcbe9e02ac5fe430535e30b4c6897e3f3d10d2f83a5a","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TencentCloudADP/youtu-agent/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T17:00:55.194Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-03-21T07:18:28Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TencentCloudADP/youtu-agent/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T17:03:24.548Z","hash":"3a48406f752768459010fcbe9e02ac5fe430535e30b4c6897e3f3d10d2f83a5a","originalBytes":25226,"storedBytes":25226,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["agent","youtu-agent","llm","examples","generation","api","tool","analysis","documentation","key","search","bash","config","file","tools","python","run","training","utu","web","framework","model","optimization","scripts","simple","base","evaluation","new","svg","using","webwalkerqa","agents","code","data","env","example","free","like","models","note","open-source","performance","readme.md","research","start